  "subject": "A woman finally returns a glass casserole dish with her friend's name on masking tape on the bottom, borrowed nineteen years ago when soup was brought after her baby was born, and stands holding it outside her friend's old door.",
  "caption": "Cantonese slowcore indie ballad, very slow sparse pulse. Clean electric guitar with slow tremolo, felt-muted upright piano, upright bass, brushed snare and soft kick, one sustained cello line. Sparse dry room recording, lo-fi tape warmth, wide silence between phrases. Female alto, plain and steady, low-mid register, clearly sung melody on every line. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 70 BPM, D minor. Hushed, wistful, grateful and quietly hopeful. No trap drums, no autotune, no rap, no EDM drops, no synth pads, no distorted guitar, no orchestral swell.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n廚房櫃頂 有隻玻璃碟\n底部貼住 一條膠紙\n上面寫住 阿玲兩個字\n十九年前 佢拎過嚟\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我啱啱生完仔 手軟腳軟\n佢煲咗一鍋湯 送嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n我拎住隻碟 行上去\n撳門鐘之前 先深呼吸\n唔知你仲住唔住喺度\n我只想講 一聲多謝\n\n[Verse]\n後來你搬咗屋 我又冇空\n訊息愈嚟愈少 愈嚟愈靜\n每次諗起 都想打畀你\n又話 遲啲先講\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n碟邊有道裂痕\n都係我當年 整嘅\n\n[Chorus]\n我拎住隻碟 行上去\n撳門鐘之前 先深呼吸\n唔知你仲住唔住喺度\n我只想講 一聲多謝\n\n[Verse]\n隔離門打開 一個阿姨\n話 阿玲而家搬咗落去\n一樓舊舖頭 開咗間店\n佢仲煲湯 賣畀人\n\n[Bridge]\n我行落樓梯 一步一步\n聞到 湯嘅味\n\n[Chorus]\n我拎住隻碟 行入嚟\n你抬頭望我 呆咗一陣\n話你終於 拎返嚟喇\n嚟 坐低 飲碗湯先\n\n[Outro]\n碟底嗰兩個字 貼咗好耐\n今晚 我哋再煲湯",
